<title>USA: Pitt-Des Moines sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Pitt-Des Moines sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pitt-Des Moines Inc said Thursday its board declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will be distributed on March 28 to shareholders of record on March 14, it said.</p>
<p>The  board also declared a quarterly dividend of 27-1/2 cents a share on all shares, including those issued as a result of the split. The cash dividend is payable on March 28 to shareholders of record on March 14.</p>
<p>Pitt-Des Moines is a diversified engineering and construction company that also processes and distributes a broad range of carbon steel products.</p>
</text>
